OL,3,GNEWSAFloating nature islands installed 
OL,4,Ain parks as Glasgow Games legacy       
OL,6,FFloating islands are being installed on
OL,7,Fponds in five of Glasgow's parks as    
OL,8,Fpart of the 2026 Commonwealth Games    
OL,9,Flegacy.                                
OL,11,FThe islands, which are being planted by
OL,12,Fcommunity groups, are designed to      
OL,13,Fencourage wildlife and help clean the  
OL,14,Fwater.                                 
OL,16,FThe project will create almost 250     
OL,17,Fsquare metres of new wildlife habitat  
OL,18,Fwhich is expected to last about 20     
OL,19,Fyears.                                 
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
